flowchart LR
    Client[Enterprise API Consumers] --> Edge[Azure Front Door or API Management]
    Edge --> Web[ASP.NET Core Web API]
    Web --> App[Application Layer]
    App --> Domain[Domain Model]
    App --> Infra[Infrastructure Adapters]
    Infra --> Sql[(Azure SQL or SQL Server)]
    Infra --> Cache[(Redis Cache)]
    Infra --> Bus[(Message Bus)]
    Web --> Obs[OpenTelemetry and Logs]
    Obs --> Monitor[Azure Monitor or App Insights]
